Embedded data

The Codex leg counts prompt tokens with OpenAI's o200k_base encoding. The
vocabulary is compiled into the utraque binary through the module below,
which carries it as generated Go source; nothing is downloaded at runtime.
It is called out here, unlike ordinary library dependencies, because the
binary redistributes that data.

  * tiktoken-go/tokenizer
    https://github.com/tiktoken-go/tokenizer
    License: MIT
    Copyright (c) 2023 tiktoken-go

  * dlclark/regexp2 (the tokenizer's regular-expression engine)
    https://github.com/dlclark/regexp2
    License: MIT
